<view class="community"><view class="title">常驻合作与定向需求</view><view class="notice">合作条件由双方确认后保存。修改设置不影响已有合作；如需新条款，请结束原合作后重新申请。折扣目前仅作为报价参考，由工程师在报价中体现，不自动改变支付金额。</view><view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}" bindtap="load">{{error}} · 重试</view>
<view wx:if="{{setting}}" class="card"><view class="title">我的合作设置</view><view>开放合作 <switch checked="{{setting.enabled}}" bindchange="toggle"/></view><text>合作折扣（1—10折；10表示不打折）</text><input type="digit" data-key="discountInput" value="{{setting.discountInput}}" bindinput="input"/><text>响应承诺（小时）</text><input type="number" data-key="responseHours" value="{{setting.responseHours}}" bindinput="input"/><text>排期说明</text><textarea data-key="scheduleNote" value="{{setting.scheduleNote}}" bindinput="input" maxlength="500"/><text>免费修改次数</text><input type="number" data-key="revisionCount" value="{{setting.revisionCount}}" bindinput="input"/><text>最低项目预算（元）</text><input type="digit" data-key="minYuan" value="{{setting.minYuan}}" bindinput="input"/><button bindtap="save" disabled="{{busy}}" loading="{{busy}}">保存设置</button></view>
<view wx:if="{{target}}" class="card"><view class="title">{{target.engineer.nickname}}的合作条件</view><view wx:if="{{target.settings.enabled}}"><view>参考折扣：{{target.settings.discountText}}</view><view>响应：{{target.settings.responseHours}}小时内</view><view>修改：{{target.settings.revisionCount}}次 / 最低预算：¥{{target.settings.minText}}</view><view class="body">排期：{{target.settings.scheduleNote||'双方协商'}}</view><textarea placeholder="合作意向说明（选填）" value="{{message}}" bindinput="message" maxlength="1000"/><checkbox-group bindchange="check"><label><checkbox value="yes" checked="{{confirmed}}"/>已阅读并确认当前合作条件</label></checkbox-group><button bindtap="invite" disabled="{{busy||!confirmed||user.role!=='CUSTOMER'}}">发起长期合作意向</button></view><view wx:else>暂未开放常驻合作</view></view>
<view class="title">我的合作关系</view><view class="card" wx:for="{{relations}}" wx:key="id"><view>{{item.customerName}} ↔ {{item.engineerName}}</view><view>{{item.statusText}}</view><view class="muted">确认条件：{{item.terms.discountText}} · {{item.terms.responseHours}}小时响应 · {{item.terms.revisionCount}}次修改 · 最低¥{{item.terms.minText}}</view><view class="body">{{item.terms.scheduleNote}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.message}}</view><view class="row" wx:if="{{item.status==='PENDING'}}"><button wx:if="{{user.id===item.engineerId}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-action="ACCEPT" bindtap="act" disabled="{{busy}}">同意合作</button><button wx:if="{{user.id===item.engineerId}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-action="REJECT" bindtap="act" disabled="{{busy}}">拒绝</button><button wx:else data-id="{{item.id}}" data-action="CANCEL" bindtap="act" disabled="{{busy}}">撤销申请</button></view><view class="row" wx:if="{{item.status==='ACTIVE'}}"><button wx:if="{{user.id===item.customerId}}" data-id="{{item.engineerId}}" bindtap="publish">向TA定向下单</button><button data-id="{{item.id}}" data-action="END" bindtap="act" disabled="{{busy}}">结束合作</button></view></view><button wx:if="{{hasMore}}" bindtap="moreRelations">更多合作</button>
<view class="title">定向需求进度</view><view class="card" wx:for="{{directs}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="order"><view>{{item.projectName}}</view><view class="muted">指定：{{item.engineerName}} · {{item.status==='QUOTING'?'等待报价或客户选择':item.status}} · 查看详情 ›</view></view><view wx:if="{{!directs.length}}" class="muted">暂无定向需求。合作中的客户可通过上方入口创建。</view><button wx:if="{{directMore}}" bindtap="moreDirects">更多定向需求</button></view>
